  "short_description": "<p>Elegant handwoven bamboo gift box, made in Vietnam. A natural packaging solution for eco-friendly brands, available for wholesale and custom orders.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"612\">Make your gift presentation as meaningful as the gift itself with our <strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"412\">handwoven bamboo gift box</strong>, crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam. Made from 100% natural bamboo, this eco-friendly box offers a sustainable alternative to plastic or paper packaging, while adding an artisanal, elegant touch.</p>\n<p data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"902\">Lightweight yet durable, each box is carefully woven to ensure strength, breathability, and a refined aesthetic. Perfect for packaging jewelry, cosmetics, spa products, tea, candles, and handmade items — it’s a favorite among eco-conscious brands, gift companies, and hospitality clients.</p>\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1069\">As a <strong data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"951\">Vietnam-based manufacturer and factory</strong>, we offer <strong data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1012\">custom sizes, shapes, branding (logo stamping)</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1043\">bulk wholesale supply</strong> for international buyers.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1071\" data-end=\"1074\" />\n<h3 data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1101\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1099\">Key Features:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1172\">\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1172\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1107\" data-end=\"1130\">100% Natural Bamboo</strong> – Biodegradable, renewable, and stylish</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1248\">\n<p data-start=\"1175\" data-end=\"1248\">✋ <strong data-start=\"1177\" data-end=\"1213\">Handwoven by Vietnamese Artisans</strong> – Supporting rural craftsmanship</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1332\">\n<p data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1332\">🎁 <strong data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1284\">Perfect for Gift Packaging</strong> – Cosmetics, crafts, wedding favors, and more</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1409\">\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1409\">🏭 <strong data-start=\"1338\" data-end=\"1369\">Factory Direct from Vietnam</strong> – Competitive pricing for bulk orders</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1478\">\n<p data-start=\"1412\" data-end=\"1478\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"1415\" data-end=\"1435\">OEM/ODM Services</strong> – Custom logo, colors, closures, and sizes</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2213\">\n<hr data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2218\" />\n<p data-start=\"2220\" data-end=\"2413\">📦 <strong data-start=\"2223\" data-end=\"2231\">MOQ:</strong> 300 pcs<br data-start=\"2239\" data-end=\"2242\" />🕒 <strong data-start=\"2245\" data-end=\"2259\">Lead Time:</strong> 25–35 days<br data-start=\"2270\" data-end=\"2273\" />📩 <strong data-start=\"2276\" data-end=\"2286\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2287\" data-end=\"2310\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"2310\" data-end=\"2313\" />📞 <strong data-start=\"2316\" data-end=\"2334\">WhatsApp/Zalo:</strong> +84-975-810-168<br data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2353\" />🌐 <strong data-start=\"2356\" data-end=\"2368\">Website:</strong> <a class=\"\" href=\"https://www.vietcraft.vn\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2413\">www.vietcraft.vn</a></p>",
